<title>AUSTRIA: SOCCER-AUSTRIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUSTRIAN FIRST DIVISION RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
